{
  "id": "poem-c7d1255e3ea9ceb8593eb36a",
  "title": "忆仙姿・如梦令·彩舫解维官柳",
  "author": "贺铸",
  "dynasty": "宋",
  "verses": [
    "彩舫解维官柳。",
    "楼上谁家红袖。",
    "团扇弄微风，如为行人招手。",
    "回首。",
    "回首。",
    "云断武陵溪口。"
  ],
  "enabled": true,
  "collection": "宋词选",
  "source": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee/宋词/ci.song.4000.json#record-51",
